# Stage-2 / pgphoto binary region for issue #251

This directory holds the provenance-pinned ARM binary region needed by
issue #15 (ARM user-space emulation for executable Stage-2 lifecycle tests)
and consumed by patcher issue #251.

## Status

**NOT CHECKED IN** — The actual binary region from the v90-era
`capture_image_with_Bulb` capture lifecycle must NOT be published on GitHub.
It is extracted read-only from `pgphoto.stage2ondisk` in the private research
repository. This placeholder documents how to obtain it locally.

## Provenance (recorded from extraction)

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Source issue | ian-morgan99/benro-polaris-firmware-patcher#251 |
| Source binary | pgphoto.stage2ondisk (v90-era) |
| Symbol | capture_image_with_Bulb |
| Entry address | 0x101aac |
| Size | 2176 bytes |
| Mode | arm (ELF flags 0x5000200, Version5 EABI, soft-float ABI) |
