| Patcher commit | 8c015c0a73c8affea8fa723badcceb4070ef81b4 |
| Harness revision | 9e7afdc (provenance recorded 2026-10-31) |
| Emulator version | unicorn-2.1.4 |
| Fixture/stub profile | lifecycle (camera/libgphoto/os/timer/callback, per-boundary `abi_shape`) |
